{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"f17e4d03-c1c1-4525-9925-f35484f1b4f8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full context. Q1.2 is about:\n\n**问题**: 在算法层面，针对 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 四类模型负载，分别有哪些可加速单请求推理的方法？（稀疏 gating/top-k 优化、权重量化 INT8/FP8/INT4/NF4、激活量化、知识蒸馏为更小 student 模型、KV-cache 压缩/选择性裁剪、token 合并/剪枝 ToMe、early-exit/动态深度、推测解码 speculative decoding、step distillation/consistency models for DiT、多模态的模态剪枝/模态稀疏化、Video 的帧跳过/选择性帧推理等——逐方法说明算法原理，特别分析各方法对硬件体系结构的依赖或适配性，如量化对 Tensor Core/NPU MAC 单元利用率的提升、稀疏 gating 对 memory bandwidth 的压力变化）\n\n**预关键词**: 稀疏gating, sparse gating, top-k routing, expert capacity, 模型量化, quantization, INT8, FP8, INT4, NF4, GPTQ, AWQ, SmoothQuant, 知识蒸馏, knowledge distillation, logit distillation, feature distillation, KV-cache压缩, KV-cache compression, eviction policy, sliding window, token合并, token merging, ToMe, bipartite matching, early-exit, early exiting, dynamic inference depth, 推测解码, speculative decoding, draft model, consistency models, step distillation, 模态剪枝, modality pruning, 帧跳过, frame skipping, selective frame, 硬件适配, hardware adaptation, Tensor Core利用率, memory bandwidth\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Semantic segmentation of the question and keywords\n2. Search across 4 directories (paper_secs/, knowledge_notes/, experiment_notes/, idea_notes/) for each keyword group\n3. Deduplicate and read top results\n4. Write comprehensive answer\n\nLet me start by doing parallel searches across the 4 directories for the main keyword groups. I'll organize keywords into semantic groups and search.\n\nThe key semantic groups are:\n1. MoE sparse gating / top-k routing optimization\n2. Quantization (INT8/FP8/INT4/NF4, GPTQ, AWQ, SmoothQuant)\n3. Knowledge distillation (logit/feature distillation)\n4. KV-cache compression (eviction, sliding window)\n5. Token merging/pruning (ToMe, bipartite matching)\n6. Early-exit / dynamic depth\n7. Speculative decoding / draft model\n8. Consistency models / step distillation (for DiT)\n9. Modality pruning / modality sparsification (multimodal)\n10. Frame skipping / selective frame (Video)\n11. Hardware adaptation (Tensor Core utilization, memory bandwidth)\n\nLet me search each group across all 4 directories. I'll use multiple parallel Agent calls to search broadly.","signature":"f17e4d03-c1c1-4525-9925-f35484f1b4f8"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":22259,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":12160,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b8f4a573-b28d-475e-9bbe-97f6df95b51b","uuid":"8846da75-2d84-452a-bab0-648712864e63"}
